{"title":"1997 AHSME Problems/Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_3\">Problem 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/3/b13f21416d84e13708696f34dea81026cda583c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> are real numbers such that\n</p>\n<center><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/a/b5a9f6e5a95f76eda476bf20df06fc2bdb1e8fc9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x-3)^2 + (y-4)^2 + (z-5)^2 = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"265\" height=\"19\" />,</center>\n<p>then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/8/d/c8d3cce84f372db8d1b683ed5253d51242fd03f6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x + y + z =$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"92\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/c/6cc2e102ce39d8fef70973406872b426da2c6a50.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A)\\ } -12 \\qquad \\mathrm{(B) \\ }0 \\qquad \\mathrm{(C) \\  } 8 \\qquad \\mathrm{(D) \\  } 12 \\qquad \\mathrm{(E) \\  }50$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"391\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If the sum of three squared expressions is zero, then each expression itself must be zero, since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/f/f/5ffb352af9667f594bd77ec4d2ce7a0074f1891c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^2 \\ge 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"50\" height=\"17\" /> with the equality iff <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/c/69cefa6855d2216036df094012f7ad2a7e4e204f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"45\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>In this case, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/b/0/9b0c4186755d8e0261b70306064403ae1ab7035c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x-3=0$\" width=\"74\" height=\"12\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/7/3/273ede852aa29d763f16d74ba71ee666d90fd3d2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y-4=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"73\" height=\"16\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/a/4/3a453a33e3b492619df3ecec282dd1f5149233b2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z-5=0$\" width=\"73\" height=\"12\" />.  Adding the three equations and moving the constant to the right gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/9/a5985534b7253b52e79b5bc5b169c278fc70e56f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x + y + z = 12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"118\" height=\"17\" />, and the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/b/55bdade53f471aab49f63d1a734979cc0c636640.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{D}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"29\" height=\"25\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsec